cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the version-specific Zenodo record for the release you used."
title: "Condensate Analysis App"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Oke"
    given-names: "David"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/okedavid111/condensate-analysis-app"
abstract: >-
  A cross-platform local Python application for microscopy ROI review,
  reproducible image cleaning, Fiji/ImageJ-based Pearson and directional
  Manders colocalization, condensate count and size measurement,
  partition-coefficient analysis, fixed-cell MS2 measurements, quality
  control, and Excel reporting.
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - condensates
  - colocalization
  - Fiji
  - ImageJ
  - Pearson correlation
  - Manders coefficient
  - partition coefficient
  - image analysis
